cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "CodeDoc: Standards-Guided and Dependency-Aware Code-Level Documentation Generation"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a standards-guided, dependency-aware approach to code-level
  documentation generation. Documentation is generated per code entity from the entity's
  source, its file path, and its static dependency context, steered by an explicit criterion
  set derived from documentation standards (ISO/IEC/IEEE 26514 and GitHub documentation
  style), and judged against that same criterion set so that generation and evaluation share
  one definition of quality.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
repository-code: "https://github.com/DZYCD/CodeEval"
keywords:
  - software documentation
  - documentation generation
  - large language models
  - static analysis
  - software engineering standards
  - ISO/IEC/IEEE 26514
